# The full transcript after a notice mid-answer (`.prd/tui-phase4` F5, T2's
# `notice-midstream`): a refusal and `/version` typed while the answer's
# second paragraph streams, then Ctrl-O at the end, paged to the top where
# the session's and the stream's full-detail records sit under the welcome.
gateway notice-midstream-turn.json
wait 2
type stream a long answer please
key Enter
held
type /notacommand
wait 0.3
key Enter
wait 0.7
type /version
wait 0.3
key Enter
wait 0.7
release
wait 5
snap end
key C-o
wait 1
snap full
key PPage
wait 0.6
snap full-pgup
key PPage
wait 0.6
snap full-top
